Package: fosos-cli
Version: 0.2.6
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: apt, sudo
Recommends: polkitd
Maintainer: FosOS <dev@fosos.local>
Description: fos command and passwordless admin for sudo users
 Provides fos for updating, upgrading, installing, removing, and repairing
 packages. Upgrade uses apt full-upgrade so new Depends are not kept back.
 APT remains available for every other operation. Members of the sudo group
 may use sudo and polkit (pkexec) without a password when polkitd is
 installed; login and lock screen still use the account password.
